# Camera masters for the customers-page video (121MB + 118MB). Kept on disk so the web
# encodes in public/assets/video/ can be regenerated, never committed: GitHub rejects any
# blob over 100MB, and public/ is copied verbatim into the Bluehost upload bundle.
